Package: MultiAgeClock
Title: Frozen Multimodal Biological Age Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MultiAgeClock", "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "128982595+Misaka-15134@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Applies frozen clinical, proteomic, metabolomic and integrated
    biological age models to complete tabular inputs. Provides model input
    dictionaries, five-model-ensemble inference, frozen age calibration and
    file scoring. Model parameters are distributed separately from the package.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: readxl, writexl
URL: https://github.com/Misaka-15134/MultiAgeClock
BugReports: https://github.com/Misaka-15134/MultiAgeClock/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
